<title>PORTUGAL: Bank/Portugal offers 320 bln esc repo.</title>
<headline>Bank/Portugal offers 320 bln esc repo.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal said it offered to inject 320 billion escudos of eight-day funds into the money market in a variable-rate repurchase tender.</p>
<p>Bids must be presented by 1415 GMT.</p>
<p>The repo takes effect on Monday.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
